# dev/ is the owner's working notebook - specs, decisions, runbook, spikes -
# and stays local. The taste material is the exception: the gate suites read
# dev/taste/gate-1 and gate-2, so those artifacts have to ship or CI cannot run.
dev/*
!dev/TASTE.md
!dev/taste/

# Recorded with the owner's own token: a self-query returns private
